Test-only dependency jars for the JUnit 4 unit tests.

**Not in git.** Only this README is tracked; the jars are gitignored. They are
downloaded from Maven Central into this directory by `ant resolve-test-deps`,
which runs automatically from `junit-build` (so `ant junit-test` / `ant test`
fetch them on first use). A plain `ant build` or `ant release` does not
download anything.

Version pins: `junit.version` and `hamcrest.version` in `build.xml`.

| Jar | Source |
|-----|--------|
| junit-* | Maven Central (junit:junit) |
| hamcrest-* | Maven Central (org.hamcrest:hamcrest) |
